[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0419","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0419.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0500","title":"BEA Systems WebLogic Express 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"BEA WebLogic Express 3.1.8/4/5 及其基础版本 WebLogic 5.1.0 存在源代码泄露漏洞。该漏洞源于系统默认配置中 servlet 处理 `/file/` 开头的请求时，未经任何安全检查就直接显示源代码文件的内容，导致攻击者能够轻易获取应用程序的源代码。这种安全缺陷允许未经身份验证的远程攻击者通过简单地向目标系统发送包含 `/file/` 前缀的HTTP请求，直接访问服务器上的源代码文件，从而暴露了系统的内部实现细节和潜在的敏感信息。这不仅破坏了信息的保密性，还可能为攻击者提供进一步攻击系统的信息支持。该漏洞影响范围广泛，攻击条件简单，利用方式直接，严重威胁了Web应用的安全性和信息保护。官方安全公告中已确认此漏洞的存在，并建议用户更新到最新补丁版本以修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0500"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-21T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52.023","remediation":"升级至 BEA WebLogic 6.0 或更高版本（已修复该默认配置问题）；或在 web.xml 中移除/禁用默认 servlet 的 /file/* 映射；临时缓解可在 Web 服务器/防火墙层面拦截所有以 /file/ 开头的请求路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96161462915381&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1378","http://www.weblogic.com/docs51/admindocs/http.html#file","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4775","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20027","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/d4b28c21b943332687c38515600e40190ff00a4e/2000/CVE-2000-0500.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0500.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0500","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0500.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j4g2-g246-6526/GHSA-j4g2-g246-6526.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0500.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/dark-warlord14/Unofficial-OSWE-Exam-Notes/blob/031d7fbe69f52a1f2fa93ab0e5fd5f355d9b98af/more_notes/perl.md","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--062d6540-cb36-4617-9700-335d747c1187.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0419.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0419.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0419.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0610","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0610.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0533","title":"SGI IRIX WorkShop 本地任意文件写入漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX WorkShop 调试与性能工具套件中 cvconnect 组件存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者利用程序对文件路径处理不当的缺陷，通过构造特制的参数执行 cvconnect，可将任意内容写入系统任意文件，从而导致权限提升或系统服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 SGI IRIX 操作系统多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0533"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2000-06-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:56.420","remediation":"升级 SGI IRIX 至包含补丁的版本（如 6.5.x 以上），或移除 cvconnect 的 setuid 位：chmod u-s /usr/bin/cvconnect。如无法升级，限制可执行 cvconnect 的用户组，仅允许受信任管理员使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-21T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1379","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4725"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0610.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0519","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0519.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0466","title":"IBM AIX cdmount 本地特权提升漏洞","description":"AIX cdmount 命令存在命令注入漏洞，本地攻击者可通过向 cdmount 命令传递精心构造的 Shell 元字符（如分号、反引号等），注入并以 root 权限执行任意 Shell 命令，从而实现本地权限提升至 root。该漏洞影响 IBM AIX 操作系统的 cdmount 命令，攻击条件为攻击者已拥有本地低权限账户访问权限且能调用 cdmount 命令，利用方式为在命令参数中注入 Shell 元字符执行任意代码，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），影响机密性、完整性和可用性均为完全影响。IBM 已发布补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0466"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-20T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:47.697","remediation":"升级 AIX 至 5.1 TL06 SP4 或更高版本，并安装 IBM 发布的 IY13244 补丁修复 cdmount 命令注入漏洞。若无法立即升级，请使用 chmod 4750 限制 cdmount 仅允许可信用户执行，并配置 /etc/security/user 中的 shell=/bin/false 限制受影响账户的 shell 访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1384","http://xforce.iss.net/alerts/advise55.php","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0466.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0466","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0466.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0466.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f7w2-c6cq-8jqg/GHSA-f7w2-c6cq-8jqg.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0466.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152400_152500.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b144fec8-7de2-449b-b857-149273e20156.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0519.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0748","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0748.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0620","title":"X.Org X11 libX11 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"libX11 X 客户端库存在拒绝服务漏洞，当接收到资源掩码值为 0 的请求时，libX11 会进入无限循环导致进程挂起。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标 X 服务器发送特制的资源掩码数据包触发该漏洞，造成服务不可用。该漏洞影响 Open Group X11r6 3.3.3/3.3.4/3.3.5/3.3.6/4.0 等版本，CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0620"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-19T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:07.550","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.0.1 或更高版本（X11R6 3.3.x 用户升级至 3.3.7），修复 libX11 在处理 resource_mask 为 0 时进入无限循环的漏洞。如无法立即升级，应在防火墙或 xinetd 配置中禁用 XDMCP 服务（TCP 端口 177/UDP 端口 177），并移除 xterm、xlock、xscreensaver 等 X 客户端程序的 setuid/setgid 权限位，避免以 root 身份运行 xdm 等 X 会话管理器，阻断攻击者通过恶意 X 服务器触发无限循环或进一步利用的路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96146116627474&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1409","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4996","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dbab824db2d42b734971c1b87553018066aa35d2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0620.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0620","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beabc13489602b94b6c532f1aa3931e9e9fc2bc0/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0620.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e90b2f048f8d5dc2c03ffbfc9a042a055738ffe6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0620.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c94c1772ba718b7f105ed32361c896b35042b2b3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-48mx-245h-4c59/GHSA-48mx-245h-4c59.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0620.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0e85afe9-ff2e-404e-9d48-c44f2710a090.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0620.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/347cae37a6aeb255699ae8f2233008d7ce722509/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0748.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0599","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0599.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0528","title":"Net Tools PKI Server 访问控制漏洞","description":"Net Tools PKI 服务器在 XUDA 模板文件未包含其他文件的绝对路径名时，未能正确限制远程攻击者的访问权限，导致访问控制失效。远程未经认证的攻击者可利用路径遍历缺陷访问服务器上本应受限的文件，造成部分完整性破坏（CVSS 5.0，AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:P/A:N）。该漏洞影响 Net Tools PKI 服务器相关版本，攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程利用，通过构造恶意路径请求读取或篡改服务器敏感文件，导致数据完整性部分受损。Net Tools 已发布补丁修复该路径遍历访问控制缺陷，建议用户尽快升级至修复版本并配置严格的文件访问控制策略。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0528"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-19T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:55.743","remediation":"建议立即升级 Net Tools PKI Server 到最新修补版本（建议升级至 2.0 版本或更高版本，官方已发布修补补丁）。若无法立即升级，必须在所有 XUDA 模板文件中使用绝对路径名引用其他文件，并配置 PKI 服务器访问控制列表（ACL）限制仅允许受信任 IP 访问。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制 PKI 服务器端口（默认 80/443）仅允许信任 IP 访问，并禁用匿名访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0166.html","http://www.osvdb.org/4353","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1364","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4743","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0528.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0528","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0528.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0528.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-9hfg-247m-vwx7/GHSA-9hfg-247m-vwx7.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0528.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5cf1d735-259d-4791-8f9d-38b9db0ae78c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/8c4383d71e419cb5a91546cd7835b4f02c87cdaa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0599.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0421","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0421.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0504","title":"Open Group X11r6 3.3.3/3.3.4/3.3.5/3.3.6/4.0 libICE SKIP_STRING 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Open Group X11R6 libICE 库中的 SKIP_STRING 宏存在输入验证缺陷，未对大数值进行边界检查。远程未认证攻击者可发送构造的大数值数据包触发整数溢出或缓冲区溢出，导致 X 服务崩溃拒绝服务。影响 XFree86 3.3.3-4.0、GNOME 1.0/1.1、X11R6 3.3.x/4.0 等 X Window 系统。攻击无需认证、网络远程可利用、攻击复杂度低，仅影响可用性（CVSS 5.0 MEDIUM）。攻击者发送恶意 ICE 协议数据包即可触发拒绝服务，ExploitDB 已有公开 PoC (EDB-20023)。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0504"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-19T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52.550","remediation":"建议升级 XFree86 到 4.0.1 及以上版本，或应用 XFree86 3.3.6 官方安全补丁（XFree86-SA-2000:002）。若无法立即升级，请在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 6000-6063 端口（X11 端口范围）的外部访问，或在不需要远程 X11 时禁用 X 服务的 TCP 监听（启动 X 服务时添加 -nolisten tcp 参数）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0170.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1369","http://www.xfree86.org/security/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20023","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0504.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0504","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0504.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7f7e3d84312983fcf49d3199fbaaf2fad83c05d2/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0504.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-p8mh-8cvx-pv92/GHSA-p8mh-8cvx-pv92.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/7c450063cd3f12f7aa97a070bb18c68d6bc6767e/content/CVE-2000-0504.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--2317d1c8-61e2-47c8-bf98-170dd131bdc2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0421.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0421.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0421.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0652","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0652.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0561","title":"International Telecommunications WebBBS 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"International Telecommunications WebBBS 论坛系统存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向 WebBBS 服务器发送精心构造的超长参数或请求数据，触发栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址或函数指针，从而在服务器进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 International Telecommunications WebBBS 早期版本，攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过构造恶意 HTTP 请求或表单参数触发缓冲区溢出，获取服务器控制权限，可导致服务器完全沦陷、数据窃取或进一步横向渗透。攻击条件为目标服务器运行受影响版本的 WebBBS 且 Web 服务对外开放，攻击者仅需发送恶意构造的 HTTP 请求即可触发。厂商已发布补丁修复该缓冲区溢出漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0561"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2000-06-19","updated":"2000-06-19","remediation":"建议升级 International Telecommunications WebBBS 至 4.30 或更高版本，该版本修复了 POST 请求中长字符串导致的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，可通过 Web 服务器配置限制 POST 请求体大小（如 Apache LimitRequestBody 102400）或在 Web 应用防火墙层面拦截超长 POST 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0561.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0561","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0561.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0561.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-485w-vv83-53fx/GHSA-485w-vv83-53fx.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2000-0561.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/