tle":"Shadow Op Software Dragon FTP Server 远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Shadow Op Software Dragon Server 1.0 和 2.0 版本 FTP 服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于服务器在处理用户认证请求时对 USER 命令的长度缺乏有效校验，未经身份认证的远程攻击者只需向目标 FTP 服务发送超长 USER 命令即可触发服务异常或崩溃，导致合法用户无法正常使用 FTP 服务。攻击者无需任何凭据即可在远程发起攻击，攻击条件简单且攻击成功率高。受影响版本包括 Dragon Server 1.0 及 2.0，可造成服务完全中断。厂商建议用户升级至安全版本或通过防火墙限制 FTP 访问来源以缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0479"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:49.370","remediation":"立即停止使用 Dragon Server 1.0/2.0，该软件已停止维护且存在未修复漏洞。迁移至受支持的 FTP 服务器（如 vsftpd 3.0.5+、ProFTPD 1.3.8+ 或 FileZilla Server），并验证新服务器对超长 USER 命令具有输入长度校验。如短期内无法替换，应在防火墙或 IDS 中部署规则拦截 FTP USER 命令超过 200 字符的连接，同时对 FTP 服务实施连接速率限制，每个源 IP 每分钟最多允许 5 次连接尝试，以降低拒绝服务攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96113734714517&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1352","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1781cc6a314747dfce9d8864a3f090ef8f0a6f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0479.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0479","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/21f29c262df67f8fba785d468c4552b0e1fc4211/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0479.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/426b24561da5907e2706f7cda3b65ab75123f3ba/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0479.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-hc82-7mvf-f3c5/GHSA-hc82-7mvf-f3c5.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/dragon_ftp.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0479.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1352/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0532.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0420","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0420.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0501","title":"Alt-N MDaemon 2.8.5.0 UIDL 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Alt-N MDaemon 2.8.5.0 POP 服务器存在竞态条件漏洞，本地攻击者可通过发送 UIDL 命令后迅速断开连接，触发 POP 服务器在处理 UIDL 命令时的竞态条件，导致服务器进程崩溃或服务拒绝，造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 Alt-N MDaemon 2.8.5.0 版本的 POP3 服务组件，攻击者需具备本地访问权限并能连接到 POP3 服务端口，通过精确把握时机发送 UIDL 命令后立即断开连接即可触发漏洞。CVSS 评分 2.6（AV:N/AC:H/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于低危级别拒绝服务漏洞，主要影响服务可用性。Alt-N 已在后续版本中修复此竞态条件问题，建议用户升级至修复版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0501"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:52.157","remediation":"立即将 Alt-N MDaemon 升级至 2.8.5.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 POP 服务器 UIDL 命令的竞态条件漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在 MDaemon 配置中禁用 UIDL 命令（POP3 设置中取消启用 UIDL），或通过防火墙仅允许可信 IP 地址访问 POP3 服务（端口 110），以临时降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/ntbugtraq/2000-q2/0277.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1366","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4745","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20020","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e0d4b639863e3178ba8dc8b525356f8aab24b9da/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0501.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0501","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/0ff2c208a009935c4314b17ee3a2e5f8fe969a25/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0501.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/68f4381f2016d51eca45695265af085374593db5/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0501.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-697w-964q-395w/GHSA-697w-964q-395w.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0501.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x2000/1366/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0420.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0417","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0417.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0494","title":"Veritas Software Volume Manager 文件权限配置不当漏洞","description":"Veritas Volume Manager 3.0.2/3.0.3/3.0.4 版本创建了一个全局可写的 .server_pids 文件，存在文件权限配置不当漏洞。本地攻击者可向该文件写入任意命令，随后由 vmsa_server 脚本以高权限执行，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Veritas Volume Manager 3.0.2、3.0.3、3.0.4 版本，攻击条件为本地访问权限（AV:L）、低攻击复杂度（AC:L）、无需认证（Au:N），成功利用可导致系统机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失（C:C/I:C/A:C），CVSS 评分 7.2（高危）。攻击者只需本地账户权限即可向 .server_pids 文件注入恶意命令，待 vmsa_server 进程执行时触发代码执行，从而完全控制受影响系统。Veritas 已在后续版本中修复该权限配置缺陷。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0494"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:51.310","remediation":"升级至 Veritas Volume Manager 3.0.5 或更高版本修复该漏洞。若暂时无法升级，请手动将 .server_pids 文件权限修改为 644 (chmod 644 .server_pids) 并将文件所有者设为 root，防止普通用户写入恶意命令。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0151.html",