gon Server 实例，攻击者只需在具备网络可达性的前提下构造包含过长用户名的 Telnet 连接数据包即可实施攻击，造成服务中断。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0480"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-16T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:49.493","remediation":"升级 Dragon Server Telnet 服务至不受该漏洞影响的版本；如厂商已停止维护，建议迁移至 OpenSSH 等主流远程服务并禁用 Dragon Telnet 服务。临时缓解措施可在防火墙或路由器层对 Telnet 服务（默认 TCP 23 端口）实施访问控制，仅允许可信 IP 地址连接，避免公开暴露于互联网，并监控异常的长用户名登录尝试。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96113734714517&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1352","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0ff539514ffae70ea73031a227022cb4e6068a50/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0480.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0480","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/15b9930b4748080020635ede90abfd538c9b2fac/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0480.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e8d0427bbb4258584d0a829b62d0fdae8c4b4acb/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0480.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-w7j2-4h84-4q9m/GHSA-w7j2-4h84-4q9m.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/dragon_telnet.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0480.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152500_152600.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0402.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0402.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0402.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0540","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0540.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0483","title":"Zope 2.2 DTML 未授权远程修改漏洞","description":"Zope 2.2 及更早版本中的 DocumentTemplate 包存在授权绕过漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络直接向目标系统发送特制请求，绕过访问控制机制远程修改 DTMLDocuments 或 DTMLMethods 内容。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Zope 部署的 Web 应用服务器，攻击者无需凭证即可篡改模板文件，可能导致敏感信息泄露或进一步控制服务器。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级为高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0483"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-06-15T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:49.863","remediation":"立即将 Zope 升级至 2.2.1 或更高版本以修复未授权修改 DTMLDocuments/DTMLMethods 的漏洞。如暂时无法升级，应在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面限制对 DTML 相关 URL 的未授权访问，并在 Zope 管理界面中严格限定仅受信任管理员账户拥有 DTML 方法和文档的修改权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-06/0144.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0412.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-038.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1354","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000616103807.A3768%40conectiva.com.br","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Hotfix_06_16_2000/security_alert","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4716","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/359275c189930ab08ca487bc0726b002a25eef84/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0483.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0483","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/61c26bb0fa513d67ff37c47a0aee18a8017dee2d/pypi/zope/CVE-2000-0483.yml","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b3f812bd4b5f3ade59f8b9defed21f6c3f9dab55/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0483.md","https://git